    },
    "notes": "Mods made of loose files, such as textures, only load when StarfieldCustom.ini in Documents/My Games/Starfield has these two lines under [Archive]: bInvalidateOlderFiles=1 and sResourceDataDirsFinal= with nothing after the equals sign. If that folder has a Data folder of its own, the game reads loose files from there first. The game's Creations menu changes the same plugin list this app writes."
  },
